<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sodak Gaming cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sodak Gaming cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James said it downgraded Sodak Gaming Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Sodak Gaming lost 1-3/4 to 10-7/8.</p>
</text>
